{{minitoc}}
==Translingual==

===Etymology===
{{clip|mul|en:'''Bit'''ara}}.

===Symbol===
{{mul-symbol}}

# {{ISO 639|3}}

===See also===
* {{langcat}}

==English==
{{wp}}
{{multiple images
|direction=vertical
|image1=Fullcheckwithtwistsnafflealpha.jpg|caption1=snaffle bit ({{senseno|en|metal in horse's mouth}})
|image2=Concrete drill bit.JPG|caption2=drill bit ({{senseno|en|drill}})
